00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.000 line:100%
Officer He.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:42.920 line:100%
Honey. One mutton rice noodle.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.200 line:100%
-Extra coriander.
-Alright.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.400 line:100%
To go. Make it fast.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.200 line:100%
Officer He. We haven't seen you in ages.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.320 line:100%
The criminal department
is busier than the station?

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.120 line:100%
I'll be back in three days.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:55.400 line:100%
That's good. That's good.
We're all eager to have you back.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.360 line:100%
Officer He.
There's a newcomer at the station.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:00.680 line:100%
Officer… Officer Qu.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:04.120 line:100%
We've never seen him smile.
Difficult person.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.440 line:100%
Tell everyone to be at ease.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.600 line:100%
Once I'm back,
I'll get that poker face out of here.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.520 line:100%
Wait. One more noodle. No coriander.

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.600 line:100%
Alright. One more noodle. No coriander.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.040 line:100%
-Alright.
-I'm on it.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:18.960 line:20%
POLICE CODE OF CONDUCT
ON UNIFORM AND APPEARANCE

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.480 line:100%
I haven't slept for days.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:22.400 line:100%
CONFERENCE ROOM

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.840 line:100%
Seriously.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.080 line:100%
Good to see you, guys.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:29.200 line:100%
Have one.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.880 line:100%
I don't smoke. Thanks.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.000 line:100%
Hi.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:38.520 line:100%
Writing notes?

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.840 line:100%
-Let's eat after this.
-Okay.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:46.760 line:100%
Get up.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.800 line:100%
Same old rules. Long story short.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.000 line:100%
Last night,

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.400 line:100%
there was a major burglary
at the Dongshan Mine.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:00.600 line:100%
Valuable items
and important materials were lost.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:03.000 line:100%
My higher-ups were on my neck all night.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:04.680 line:100%
From now on,

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:09.720 line:100%
whoever doesn't have important tasks
will join the Special Task Force.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.880 line:100%
Tan. Give out the materials.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.319 line:100%
-Big cases? Ours?
-You in?

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.080 line:100%
Captain.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.360 line:100%
Of course, we should
prioritize the big case.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.320 line:100%
Captain Feng.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.160 line:100%
Fangxu.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.400 line:100%
You already got ideas?

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.960 line:100%
Tell us about it.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:40.200 line:100%
Everyone here will get to hear
the ideas of a PPSUC graduate.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:48.880 line:100%
Captain Feng.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.880 line:100%
The missing persons case
I'm working on is also quite urgent.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.120 line:100%
Seriously?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.280 line:100%
Seriously?

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:02.800 line:100%
Yuanhang.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.640 line:100%
Has the case in Yuanlongli been filed?

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:08.320 line:100%
Not yet.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:09.720 line:100%
How long have you been on this?

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:12.920 line:100%
Four days.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.280 line:100%
They've been investigating
around the clock,

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.840 line:100%
as busy as bees, 24 hours non-stop.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:24.440 line:100%
Yuanhang.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.680 line:100%
It's been four days.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.320 line:100%
We can't file a case
without finding the person.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.800 line:100%
But based on what we know,

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.480 line:100%
this case is highly likely
to develop into a murder.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.880 line:100%
What makes you think
it's going to be a murder?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.560 line:100%
Is that based on proof or your intuition?

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:46.400 line:100%
Captain Feng.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:48.520 line:100%
On probability.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:52.760 line:100%
Approximately 25% of missing persons cases
are ultimately classified as homicides.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:56.280 line:100%
For every four missing people,
one dies of unnatural causes.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:00.280 line:100%
And now we've passed the golden 72 hours
for finding the missing person.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.680 line:100%
Every extra day means more danger
to the missing person.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.080 line:100%
That's all.

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.680 line:100%
Captain, this kid is a bookworm.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:25.440 line:100%
Please don't mind him.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.200 line:100%
You think I don't know that?

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.320 line:100%
I was also annoyingly stubborn
when I was young.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.040 line:100%
This kid is persistent.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.920 line:100%
He'll make a good officer.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.640 line:100%
But then again,

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.600 line:100%
you are also to blame
for his stubbornness.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.160 line:100%
You've been mentoring him for days.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.600 line:100%
Is this how you train him?

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.440 line:100%
How can I mentor a college graduate?

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.920 line:100%
Besides, you never said
that I'd be his mentor.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:57.720 line:100%
Isn't he sure that it's going
to turn into a murder?

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:01.320 line:100%
How about this? Keep an eye on your area.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.720 line:100%
Transfer Ran Fangxu
to the Special Task Force.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.240 line:100%
Transfer him here to keep defying you?

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.160 line:100%
Also, we're not allowed
to work cases alone.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.280 line:100%
How about this, Captain?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.280 line:100%
Give us an official order and a deadline.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:15.080 line:100%
This way, he'll have no complaints. Okay?

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.040 line:100%
To be honest, I believe

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:22.320 line:100%
that a missing person matters more
than some lost items.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.440 line:100%
Fine. How many days do you need?

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:31.440 line:100%
Three days.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:34.160 line:100%
After three days, I'll bring that kid
to the Special Task Force.

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.440 line:100%
Captain.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.840 line:100%
When are you going back
to the police station?

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:56.320 line:100%
Also in three days.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.400 line:100%
Sneaky fox.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.120 line:100%
I…

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:07.160 line:100%
There's nothing in it for me.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.600 line:100%
I did it all for you.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:13.000 line:100%
Thank you, Officer He.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:14.760 line:100%
For what?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.680 line:100%
You should thank Captain Feng.
He values talent.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:21.120 line:100%
Also, stop addressing me so formally.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.840 line:100%
What should I call you?

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.880 line:100%
Our partnership will end soon.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.720 line:100%
I won't take advantage of you
and make you call me "sir".

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.120 line:100%
Just call me He.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.599 line:100%
He.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.240 line:100%
I will do my best
to avoid delaying your return.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:50.000 line:100%
To be honest,
I have some selfish intentions.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.520 line:100%
This case has almost become a joke.

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.080 line:100%
I can't go back empty-handed.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.960 line:100%
That's enough. Dig in. Dig in.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.520 line:100%
Clean it up afterward.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.800 line:100%
You like coriander too?

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.800 line:100%
Have this. I'll have this.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.960 line:100%
It's a bit too much.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.800 line:100%
The case of Dongshan Mine
is the real deal.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:52.480 line:100%
But you're only interested
in a minor case.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.880 line:100%
My parents also went missing.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.520 line:100%
At first, they said it was nothing.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:12.240 line:100%
But later, they found…

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.320 line:100%
their bodies.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.560 line:100%
We have three days. We have time.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.080 line:100%
Okay.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.120 line:100%
Wait.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.840 line:20%
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE, OWNER: ZHAO HONGMEI

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.320 line:20%
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE, OWNER: ZHAO HONGMEI

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.520 line:100%
How did I forget about her?

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:26.720 line:100%
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:33.880 line:100%
So annoying.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.000 line:100%
Don't slam the door.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.120 line:100%
We have zero customers
after the police visited.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.520 line:100%
Not even a fly flew in.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.560 line:100%
It's all because of Mengmeng.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:06.680 line:100%
Listen.

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:09.000 line:100%
No one is allowed
to mention Mengmeng again.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.480 line:100%
Do not gossip about her to anyone.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.000 line:100%
You hear me?

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.160 line:100%
You hear me?

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:20.560 line:100%
Yeah.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:23.520 line:100%
Lili. Get a perm.

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:26.840 line:100%
Look at your hair.
It's like a pot of plants.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.360 line:100%
Ms. Zhao.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:30.480 line:100%
I need money for that.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.960 line:100%
You haven't paid me this month.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:42.400 line:100%
Why are you staring at me?
Do I have money on my face?

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.960 line:100%
Still staring? Go get a perm.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.120 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT CONNECTS YOU AND ME

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:59.600 line:100%
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.280 line:100%
I don't know Mengmeng so well.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:24.360 line:100%
I don't know what exactly happened to her.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.680 line:100%
What happened?

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:33.120 line:100%
If I remember correctly,
you wanted to say something that night.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.680 line:100%
No one picked her.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:36.800 line:100%
She didn't earn anything,
so she stopped coming.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.280 line:100%
Why did she miss work?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:39.920 line:100%
I don't know.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:46.280 line:100%
Officer, stop pushing me.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:48.200 line:100%
I… I really don't know.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.640 line:100%
I have things to do. Can I leave now?

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:51.560 line:100%
No.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.840 line:100%
Did Zhao Hongmei threaten you?

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.320 line:100%
I can arrest her
if she's hiding something.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:05.720 line:100%
Rest assured. The information
you provide will be kept confidential.

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:08.200 line:100%
-We're just trying to find Mengmeng.
-Yeah.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:20.320 line:100%
Actually, Mengmeng had some bad luck
right before she disappeared.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.440 line:100%
Bad luck?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:28.360 line:100%
Speaking of which,
she took the hit for me.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:38.680 line:100%
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:39.920 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.840 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.400 line:100%
You finally came to inspect our work.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.920 line:100%
Be careful.

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:50.760 line:100%
Our young ladies have missed you so much.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:52.960 line:100%
Wait.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:54.760 line:100%
Briefcase.

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:56.480 line:100%
Hurry.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:04.080 line:100%
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:10.280 line:100%
Welcome, Mr. Song.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.960 line:100%
-Mei.
-Yes?

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.280 line:100%
I've traveled everywhere.

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:16.160 line:100%
This is the best place for me.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:19.120 line:100%
Wherever you say is nice,
that's the nicest place.

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:24.200 line:100%
Don't just stand there.
Hurry up and get around.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:26.640 line:100%
Get closer to Mr. Song.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:31.200 line:100%
Go ahead. Go ahead.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.920 line:100%
Mr. Song. Lili. Get him in.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.880 line:100%
How dare you snatch my things?

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:51.000 line:100%
I'll break your other leg, too.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.840 line:100%
Who are you?

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.800 line:100%
Mr. Song, I'm Lili.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:05.880 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.080 line:100%
Who said you could touch my briefcase?

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:11.000 line:100%
The essential oil might drip on it.

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.560 line:100%
Who said you could touch my briefcase?

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:13.600 line:100%
I paid for that.

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:15.440 line:100%
Who said you could touch my briefcase?

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.440 line:100%
How dare you touch my briefcase?

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.880 line:100%
-How dare you!
-Mr. Song.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.320 line:100%
What are you doing? What are you doing?

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.040 line:100%
Go away. Go away.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.960 line:100%
Why are you angry with that dumb girl?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.640 line:100%
Don't be mad. I'll get you someone else.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.160 line:100%
Mengmeng.

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:30.040 line:100%
Mengmeng is very sweet.
She'll make you happy.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:32.320 line:100%
Mengmeng. Hurry.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:37.280 line:100%
Come on. Mr. Song, this is Mengmeng.
Serve him well.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:48.440 line:100%
That briefcase says "Qingsong Cement".

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.840 line:100%
-So Mr. Song is…
-Song Qingsong.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:54.160 line:100%
There is only one Mr. Song in Weiyang.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.640 line:100%
Hundreds of people gathered for a fight
outside the cement factory a few days ago.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:59.840 line:100%
It was because of him
and Cripple Du of the steel factory.

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.440 line:100%
Those two are known to be enemies.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.919 line:100%
SONG QINGSONG

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:10.280 line:100%
Song Qingsong met Xu Meng.
What happened next?

00:17:10.919 --> 00:17:14.560 line:100%
I thought Mr. Song could calm down
after he saw Mengmeng.

00:17:14.639 --> 00:17:16.280 line:100%
But Mengmeng started screaming in there.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.480 line:100%
And Mr. Song hit her even harder.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:20.960 line:100%
Why?

00:17:22.119 --> 00:17:25.159 line:100%
I think it was still
because of that briefcase.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.159 line:100%
-How dare you!
-Mr. Song, spare me.

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.640 line:100%
Mr. Song, spare me.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:29.800 line:100%
Shut up.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:31.320 line:100%
-Still won't admit it?
-I am sorry.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.320 line:100%
Spare me.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:36.040 line:100%
I can make you disappear from Weiyang.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:37.240 line:100%
You hear me?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.520 line:100%
I can make you disappear.

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:41.560 line:100%
I'm sorry.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.600 line:100%
I'm sorry. Spare me.

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.400 line:100%
-Still crying?
-Spare me.

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:46.840 line:100%
Spare me.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.480 line:100%
Still crying, huh?

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:49.880 line:100%
I can make you disappear!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.120 line:100%
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.360 line:100%
Spare me.

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:56.440 line:100%
-Still crying?
-Spare me.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.680 line:100%
Mr. Song kept beating her in that room.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.480 line:100%
Eventually, she went silent.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:06.000 line:100%
Song Qingsong said he'd made
Xu Meng disappear from Weiyang?

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:07.120 line:100%
Yeah.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.160 line:100%
He kept repeating those words.

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:11.800 line:100%
I heard him clearly.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:14.800 line:100%
Any idea what's in that briefcase?

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.400 line:100%
White papers. A thick stack.

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.720 line:100%
It hurt so much when he hit me with those.

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.840 line:100%
Papers? Not money?

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.000 line:100%
Not money.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.240 line:100%
Maybe for rich people,

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.080 line:100%
paper is money,

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:34.960 line:100%
and money sometimes is just paper.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.880 line:100%
They say, "Life is as fragile as paper."

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:42.160 line:100%
People like us

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:45.480 line:100%
are worth less than some papers.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:59.120 line:100%
Did Song Qingsong and Xu Meng
know each other?

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:02.200 line:100%
Mengmeng and I used to work in Pattia.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.440 line:100%
Mr. Song often came
and asked for Mengmeng.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.120 line:100%
He wanted to keep her as his mistress.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.560 line:100%
But she turned him down.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.080 line:100%
That's why she got beaten
and sent to the hospital.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.520 line:100%
Didn't your boss do anything about it?

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:17.840 line:100%
She dared not.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:21.080 line:100%
Mr. Song rented her the place.
What could she do?

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:28.920 line:100%
The 18th floor of New York Block
is Song Qingsong's property?

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.520 line:100%
He also owns the dorms downstairs.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:35.000 line:100%
Did Xu Meng tell you
why she turned him down?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:37.400 line:100%
She just didn't want to be a mistress.

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:39.960 line:100%
Ms. Zhao said

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:43.200 line:100%
that Mengmeng owed a lot of money.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.720 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT CONNECTS YOU AND ME

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.280 line:100%
I just got back from a business trip.

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.040 line:100%
Mr. Liu.

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:06.400 line:100%
What I have at hand
is absolutely reliable.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:09.120 line:100%
I'll show you when the time is right.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.240 line:100%
But right now, I'm a bit short of funds.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.280 line:100%
If you're willing to help,

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:19.080 line:100%
you can wait
to make loads of money with me.

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.160 line:100%
Get back to me.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:29.200 line:100%
MISSING PERSON

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:32.200 line:100%
MUSE

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:34.160 line:100%
"Disappeared from Weiyang."

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.760 line:100%
Doesn't that sound familiar?

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.240 line:100%
You're talking about the guy
in the video rental shop?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.680 line:100%
That guy was drunk. It doesn't count.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.480 line:100%
Song Qingsong has plenty of women.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.280 line:100%
Why would he be so serious
about a massage lady?

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:55.120 line:100%
Besides, Wolfie only killed chickens.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:58.240 line:100%
Even if Song Qingsong hired Wolfie,
the murder didn't happen.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.360 line:100%
What if he hired someone else?

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:04.800 line:100%
Both Xu Meng and Lili were beaten
because they touched his briefcase.

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:07.680 line:100%
Why was only Xu Meng threatened?

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.120 line:100%
And the briefcase.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.520 line:100%
Song Qingsong didn't even trust his driver

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:16.440 line:100%
and carried it with him
to the massage place.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.720 line:100%
What was in that briefcase?

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:24.480 line:100%
A business owner usually carries
important documents,

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:26.760 line:100%
checks, and bank drafts.

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:30.240 line:100%
He.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:34.720 line:100%
Why does it sound like you're trying
to defend Song Qingsong?

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:37.200 line:100%
Really?

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:38.120 line:100%
Why?

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:44.880 line:100%
Song Qingsong and Cripple Du take turns
to be the richest man in Weiyang.

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:47.320 line:100%
They pay huge amounts of tax.

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:49.320 line:100%
Even the authorities
have to show them some respect.

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.840 line:100%
You know what I mean?

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.920 line:100%
What does it have to do with the case?

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:56.200 line:100%
We lack proof to tie them to this case.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:58.760 line:100%
That's why we can't act rashly
towards Song Qingsong.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.400 line:100%
I see.

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:07.680 line:100%
Good.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:09.200 line:100%
You're afraid of Song Qingsong.

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:12.520 line:100%
I'm afraid of Song Qingsong?

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:14.640 line:100%
I'm a police officer.
Why would I be afraid?

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.520 line:100%
We fight the bad people
and protect the good.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:20.080 line:100%
We're not sure that Song Qingsong
is a bad guy, right?

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:23.560 line:100%
He put a woman in the hospital.
How is he a good guy?

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:27.800 line:100%
Song Qingsong is known
to be a sneaky fox in Weiyang.

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:31.120 line:100%
We can't just approach him
with Lili's testimony.

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.840 line:100%
We may alert him.

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:35.240 line:100%
We must form a strategy.

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:38.240 line:100%
Like what?

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:47.160 line:100%
Well… the strategy
is to not scare off the target,

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:49.400 line:100%
but also not come away with nothing.

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:50.560 line:100%
So…

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:56.880 line:100%
So…

00:22:58.680 --> 00:22:59.960 line:100%
I need to call someone.

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:02.360 line:100%
Then I'll tell you more
about the strategy.

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:03.360 line:100%
Don't be impulsive.

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.160 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:09.440 line:100%
Didn't you say that we lack proof?

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:11.200 line:100%
I'll look for evidence at Yuanlongli now.

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:14.720 line:100%
Why do you keep going to Yuanlongli?

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:16.440 line:100%
You have a girlfriend there?

00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:20.920 line:100%
WEIYANG QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:22.480 line:100%
Come here.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:28.840 line:100%
Brother-in-law.

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:30.720 line:100%
Come closer.

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:39.080 line:100%
I paid you to deal with someone.

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:41.160 line:100%
This is how you handled it?

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:42.880 line:100%
I can explain, brother-in-law.

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:44.400 line:100%
Come here.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:51.760 line:100%
I've told you so many times.
What do you call me in the factory?

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:53.800 line:100%
Mr. Song. Mr. Song.

00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:57.360 line:100%
I made that woman disappear
as you told me to.

00:23:57.440 --> 00:23:59.080 line:100%
I hired a hitman.

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:00.840 line:100%
She and her dad. Both gone.
Only 40,000 yuan.

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:03.760 line:100%
I told you to do it in person,
but you subcontracted it.

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:05.960 line:100%
For kickbacks?

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:08.360 line:100%
No. Absolutely not. I swear.

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:09.960 line:100%
I dare not steal a penny from you.

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:13.560 line:100%
Look at me.

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:14.920 line:100%
Okay.

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:17.160 line:100%
Is that woman really dead?

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:18.400 line:100%
Yeah.

00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:21.440 line:100%
I looked into that hitman
before I hired him.

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:24.680 line:100%
He's killed several people.
He's professional.

00:24:29.760 --> 00:24:30.640 line:100%
You saw it happening?

00:24:30.720 --> 00:24:34.200 line:100%
Yeah. I saw it happening.
Buried in the mountains.

00:24:34.280 --> 00:24:35.800 line:100%
Buried in the mountains?

00:24:38.160 --> 00:24:39.680 line:100%
Why don't I believe it?

00:24:40.680 --> 00:24:42.080 line:100%
Stupid woman.

00:24:42.720 --> 00:24:44.680 line:100%
Writing to blackmail me?

00:24:50.040 --> 00:24:52.040 line:100%
Go. Dig up the body.

00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:56.120 line:100%
If she's really dead, bring me her body.

00:24:56.200 --> 00:24:57.400 line:100%
Alright. Got it.

00:24:57.480 --> 00:25:01.080 line:100%
If she is still alive,
you will disappear from Weiyang.

00:25:04.360 --> 00:25:06.720 line:100%
PUBLIC TELEPHONE

00:25:07.840 --> 00:25:13.520 line:100%
WEIYANG QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY

00:25:13.600 --> 00:25:16.760 line:100%
PUBLIC TELEPHONE

00:25:20.200 --> 00:25:21.920 line:100%
<i>-Hello.</i>
-What's up?

00:25:22.560 --> 00:25:23.520 line:100%
<i>Song Qingsong is back?</i>

00:25:23.600 --> 00:25:24.880 line:100%
Right.

00:25:24.960 --> 00:25:26.200 line:100%
<i>Did you get the thing?</i>

00:25:26.280 --> 00:25:27.680 line:100%
I'm not in the mood for this.

00:25:27.760 --> 00:25:29.560 line:100%
<i>I don't care if you're in the mood.</i>

00:25:29.640 --> 00:25:30.600 line:100%
<i>Just tell me if you got it.</i>

00:25:30.680 --> 00:25:33.960 line:100%
Will you shut up?
Are you all trying to drive me crazy?

00:25:34.040 --> 00:25:37.080 line:100%
<i>Wu Shanlong. We're in the same boat.</i>

00:25:37.160 --> 00:25:40.040 line:100%
<i>If you don't get the thing,</i>
<i>the boat could flip anytime.</i>

00:25:40.120 --> 00:25:42.920 line:100%
I got it. Exactly the same.

00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:44.480 line:100%
It's in the safe in my house now.

00:25:44.560 --> 00:25:46.360 line:100%
It's safe there. Happy now?

00:25:53.120 --> 00:25:55.120 line:100%
Ma'am. Any instructions?

00:25:55.200 --> 00:25:57.840 line:100%
<i>My mom is not feeling well today.</i>
<i>She can't cook.</i>

00:25:57.920 --> 00:25:59.760 line:100%
Huh? Is she okay?

00:26:00.280 --> 00:26:03.080 line:100%
Should I take her
to the hospital after work?

00:26:03.160 --> 00:26:05.520 line:100%
<i>Waiting for you</i>
<i>is like waiting for pigs to fly.</i>

00:26:05.600 --> 00:26:06.960 line:100%
<i>I'm assigned to a business trip.</i>

00:26:07.040 --> 00:26:08.880 line:100%
<i>Pick up Xiaohe from my mom's place.</i>

00:26:09.600 --> 00:26:10.800 line:100%
When will you be back?

00:26:10.880 --> 00:26:14.120 line:100%
Should I ask my mom
to keep Xiaohe for a few days?

00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:15.360 line:100%
<i>Last time she was there,</i>

00:26:15.440 --> 00:26:17.320 line:100%
<i>she chased mice and fell into the pigsty.</i>

00:26:17.400 --> 00:26:18.480 line:100%
<i>The countryside is not safe.</i>

00:26:18.560 --> 00:26:20.160 line:100%
<i>And what if there are abductors?</i>

00:26:20.240 --> 00:26:23.120 line:100%
Well, I'll take Xiaohe to our station.

00:26:23.200 --> 00:26:24.200 line:100%
That's the safest place.

00:26:24.280 --> 00:26:26.720 line:100%
<i>Don't let her eat ice cream</i>
<i>and drink Coke when I'm away.</i>

00:26:27.720 --> 00:26:30.280 line:100%
I wouldn't do that.
I don't even drink Coke myself.

00:26:33.080 --> 00:26:34.040 line:100%
Fine.

00:26:40.800 --> 00:26:43.160 line:100%
Countryside. What's wrong with it?

00:26:44.560 --> 00:26:45.400 line:100%
Get me another Coke.

00:26:45.480 --> 00:26:47.040 line:100%
Help yourself.

00:27:01.200 --> 00:27:02.280 line:100%
Kiddo.

00:27:03.720 --> 00:27:05.560 line:100%
Do you want to go out to work the case?

00:27:07.600 --> 00:27:09.560 line:100%
I've worked hard

00:27:10.080 --> 00:27:12.600 line:100%
and made contributions
on the Yuanlongli case.

00:27:12.680 --> 00:27:16.240 line:100%
I can tell Zhao Jie to hand this case
over to you tomorrow.

00:27:16.320 --> 00:27:17.680 line:100%
What do you think?

00:27:21.600 --> 00:27:22.520 line:100%
Tell me.

00:27:22.600 --> 00:27:26.640 line:100%
How can they put someone
so talented as you on the bench?

00:27:26.720 --> 00:27:27.680 line:100%
Right?

00:27:28.400 --> 00:27:30.400 line:100%
Your dad is experienced.

00:27:30.480 --> 00:27:31.920 line:100%
Plus your Uncle Ran.

00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:34.160 line:100%
The three of us will join forces

00:27:34.240 --> 00:27:36.320 line:100%
and crack this case in no time.

00:27:38.800 --> 00:27:41.760 line:100%
Dad. Let me emphasize it again.

00:27:42.440 --> 00:27:44.960 line:100%
Stay out of the Yuanlongli case.

00:27:45.040 --> 00:27:46.840 line:100%
And stop going to Yuanlongli.

00:27:46.920 --> 00:27:48.240 line:100%
Never again.

00:27:49.280 --> 00:27:51.360 line:100%
Why are you so worked up?

00:27:52.840 --> 00:27:53.680 line:100%
Who is it?

00:28:03.080 --> 00:28:03.920 line:100%
Ran.

00:28:04.520 --> 00:28:07.600 line:100%
Sir. How's the injury?

00:28:08.760 --> 00:28:10.960 line:100%
It's minor. Don't worry. Come in.

00:28:11.040 --> 00:28:13.320 line:100%
Kiddo. Look who's here.

00:28:16.640 --> 00:28:18.560 line:100%
This kid is so rude.

00:28:18.640 --> 00:28:22.200 line:100%
Your Uncle Ran is here.
Also, aren't you going to eat?

00:28:25.160 --> 00:28:26.440 line:100%
Acting up again?

00:28:27.040 --> 00:28:29.560 line:100%
Maybe work is stressful these days.

00:28:31.720 --> 00:28:34.200 line:100%
Oh, right. Where were you?

00:28:34.280 --> 00:28:36.800 line:100%
Why did you vanish when the police came?

00:28:38.880 --> 00:28:42.720 line:100%
I'm just a teacher.
I shouldn't cause them trouble.

00:28:42.800 --> 00:28:44.600 line:100%
Why would you say that?

00:28:44.680 --> 00:28:47.520 line:100%
By order of seniority,
you're their senior.

00:28:49.960 --> 00:28:53.000 line:100%
Come on. Let's talk in my room.
Come to my room.

00:29:38.400 --> 00:29:39.960 line:100%
-Sir.
-Yes?

00:29:40.840 --> 00:29:43.640 line:100%
All these things are about Yuanlongli?

00:29:44.240 --> 00:29:45.280 line:100%
Yeah.

00:29:45.920 --> 00:29:47.760 line:100%
These are my treasures.

00:29:48.720 --> 00:29:49.720 line:100%
And yours.

00:29:56.640 --> 00:30:00.520 line:100%
NOTEBOOK

00:30:01.920 --> 00:30:02.760 line:100%
How…

00:30:02.840 --> 00:30:07.000 line:100%
You walked away without a care
and left them there.

00:30:07.080 --> 00:30:09.480 line:100%
They naturally became mine.

00:30:11.040 --> 00:30:12.520 line:100%
Actually,

00:30:13.360 --> 00:30:14.920 line:100%
I've always had a feeling.

00:30:16.040 --> 00:30:19.120 line:100%
I've always felt that the missing people
in Yuanlongli in the past few years…

00:30:19.200 --> 00:30:19.880 line:100%
SONG QINGSONG

00:30:19.960 --> 00:30:23.680 line:100%
…were related to Xu Meng
and her father's case 18 years ago.

00:30:23.760 --> 00:30:26.040 line:100%
You saw it today.

00:30:26.120 --> 00:30:28.880 line:100%
A kid hid in Yuanlongli

00:30:28.960 --> 00:30:31.200 line:100%
and attacked whoever he saw.

00:30:31.280 --> 00:30:33.480 line:100%
Isn't it weird?

00:30:33.560 --> 00:30:36.240 line:100%
Shouldn't we look into Yuanlongli?

00:30:41.680 --> 00:30:44.800 line:100%
Sir, we found the kid.

00:30:44.880 --> 00:30:47.040 line:100%
Just leave it to the police.

00:30:47.560 --> 00:30:49.400 line:100%
We're not qualified to intervene.

00:30:52.080 --> 00:30:54.400 line:100%
Yeah. We're not qualified.

00:30:55.320 --> 00:30:57.560 line:100%
You left. I retired.

00:30:58.560 --> 00:31:01.760 line:100%
But this is Xiaohe's first case,
after all.

00:31:02.520 --> 00:31:03.880 line:100%
Xiaohe's case?

00:31:03.960 --> 00:31:05.200 line:100%
Yeah.

00:31:05.280 --> 00:31:07.640 line:100%
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:31:08.320 --> 00:31:10.480 line:100%
Zhao Jie just announced it this evening.

00:31:16.200 --> 00:31:19.640 line:100%
Xiaohe is still young.
This is her first case.

00:31:19.720 --> 00:31:22.360 line:100%
She doesn't catch on
as fast as you did back then.

00:31:22.440 --> 00:31:24.440 line:100%
This kid is way too stubborn.

00:31:24.520 --> 00:31:28.240 line:100%
She clearly needs help,
but just doesn't say it.

00:31:29.040 --> 00:31:30.080 line:100%
Ran.

00:31:30.160 --> 00:31:32.280 line:100%
I genuinely hope

00:31:32.360 --> 00:31:35.000 line:100%
that the two of us can join hands again

00:31:35.080 --> 00:31:36.880 line:100%
to help Xiaohe.

00:31:38.080 --> 00:31:40.200 line:100%
Rest assured. I promise

00:31:40.280 --> 00:31:44.840 line:100%
I will do my best
to avoid delaying your return.

00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:46.360 line:100%
Okay?

00:31:50.920 --> 00:31:52.600 line:100%
Then it's settled.

00:31:52.680 --> 00:31:54.880 line:100%
Let me thank you on behalf of Xiaohe.

00:31:59.360 --> 00:32:03.960 line:20%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:32:19.600 --> 00:32:20.880 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:32:21.600 --> 00:32:22.560 line:100%
Why are you here?

00:32:24.640 --> 00:32:25.480 line:20%
These are for you.

00:32:26.360 --> 00:32:28.440 line:100%
Why did you buy new ones? No need.

00:32:28.520 --> 00:32:30.480 line:100%
It's the least I could do.
I have to thank you.

00:32:30.560 --> 00:32:31.560 line:20%
Here.

00:32:33.280 --> 00:32:35.600 line:100%
Still, you didn't have
to come all the way here.

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:37.960 line:100%
Come in and have some water.

00:32:38.800 --> 00:32:41.280 line:100%
No need. I have things to do.

00:32:46.560 --> 00:32:49.200 line:100%
Still that thing upstairs?

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:51.840 line:100%
People have been terrified.

00:32:52.440 --> 00:32:53.680 line:100%
You haven't found her?

00:32:55.240 --> 00:32:56.440 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:32:57.040 --> 00:32:58.480 line:100%
Wang Xinglong said you came
to the fourth floor.

00:32:59.080 --> 00:33:00.480 line:100%
Wait for me. Be right there.

00:33:00.560 --> 00:33:01.560 line:100%
Okay.

00:33:07.160 --> 00:33:10.400 line:100%
Right. How's the injury?

00:33:12.080 --> 00:33:13.560 line:100%
It's basically healed.

00:33:13.640 --> 00:33:14.800 line:100%
It won't leave a scar.

00:33:23.680 --> 00:33:26.040 line:100%
Go ahead. Business first.

00:33:26.120 --> 00:33:28.280 line:100%
Tell me if you need help.

00:33:29.080 --> 00:33:30.160 line:100%
Thanks.

00:33:36.240 --> 00:33:37.320 line:100%
Then…

00:33:49.920 --> 00:33:52.000 line:20%
CASUAL SNEAKERS

00:34:03.240 --> 00:34:04.120 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:34:04.920 --> 00:34:10.439 line:100%
Do you know the deal
with that woman in 415?

00:34:10.519 --> 00:34:12.920 line:100%
-What about her?
-She was being kept as a mistress.

00:34:13.959 --> 00:34:14.840 line:100%
True.

00:34:14.920 --> 00:34:17.680 line:100%
The one who kept her was an old man.

00:34:17.760 --> 00:34:19.039 line:100%
In his seventies.

00:34:19.120 --> 00:34:24.320 line:100%
Last winter, the old man slipped
on the stairs and fell.

00:34:24.400 --> 00:34:26.439 line:100%
Cerebral hemorrhage. He died.

00:34:26.519 --> 00:34:29.680 line:100%
That apartment she lives in
belonged to that old man.

00:34:30.280 --> 00:34:34.920 line:100%
But it seems that he never gave it
to that woman.

00:34:34.999 --> 00:34:38.760 line:100%
Why did she do that? She's so pretty.

00:34:38.840 --> 00:34:42.360 line:100%
She could have married any decent guy.

00:34:42.439 --> 00:34:44.479 line:100%
Why did she pick an old man?

00:34:54.360 --> 00:34:56.320 line:100%
Officer Ran. We're here.

00:34:58.720 --> 00:35:01.000 line:100%
After Pattia was seized,

00:35:01.080 --> 00:35:05.040 line:100%
Mr. Song gave us the keys
to these two floors

00:35:05.120 --> 00:35:06.960 line:100%
and asked us to look for tenants.

00:35:07.040 --> 00:35:08.480 line:100%
This half belongs to merchants.

00:35:09.400 --> 00:35:12.320 line:100%
The left-hand side
used to be Pattia's dorm.

00:35:12.400 --> 00:35:13.720 line:100%
Which one should we check first?

00:35:15.280 --> 00:35:18.800 line:100%
QIHUANG CLINIC

00:35:33.520 --> 00:35:35.680 line:100%
<i>Raid! Raid!</i>

00:35:38.760 --> 00:35:40.360 line:100%
PRIVATE ROOM 3

00:35:43.080 --> 00:35:44.240 line:100%
That one.

00:35:44.320 --> 00:35:45.160 line:100%
Okay.

00:36:09.120 --> 00:36:10.880 line:100%
ANSWER

00:36:15.080 --> 00:36:16.680 line:20%
I DON'T BELIEVE DREAMS ARE FALSE
I DON'T BELIEVE DEATH HAS NO RETRIBUTION

00:36:16.760 --> 00:36:17.760 line:20%
IF THE SEA IS DESTINED TO BURST ITS DIKES

00:36:17.840 --> 00:36:19.160 line:20%
LET ALL THE BITTER WATERS
POUR INTO MY HEART

00:36:25.920 --> 00:36:27.280 line:100%
MENGMENG NO.23

00:36:29.560 --> 00:36:31.400 line:100%
It's their work badge in Pattia.

00:36:38.760 --> 00:36:40.480 line:100%
This is Mengmeng. Do you know her?

00:36:41.080 --> 00:36:42.640 line:100%
The missing ghost?

00:36:43.360 --> 00:36:45.240 line:100%
A suspected missing person.

00:36:48.080 --> 00:36:49.400 line:100%
I can't tell.

00:36:49.480 --> 00:36:52.960 line:100%
There are 20 or 30 young ladies
coming and going here,

00:36:53.040 --> 00:36:54.680 line:100%
all heavily made up.

00:36:54.760 --> 00:36:57.600 line:100%
I don't recognize her without makeup.

00:37:01.360 --> 00:37:03.120 line:100%
It's also a dorm next door.

00:37:03.200 --> 00:37:05.640 line:100%
Someone is still living here?

00:37:07.880 --> 00:37:09.080 line:100%
Worker of Pattia.

00:37:14.560 --> 00:37:16.440 line:100%
In the front. Where is she?

00:37:17.040 --> 00:37:18.200 line:100%
Where did she go?

00:37:35.760 --> 00:37:37.400 line:100%
Don't throw my cards away.

00:37:37.480 --> 00:37:40.000 line:100%
Where is the gaming machine? Take it out.

00:37:40.080 --> 00:37:42.120 line:100%
Do you hear me? I'm counting to three.

00:37:42.200 --> 00:37:44.160 line:100%
One. Two.

00:37:45.080 --> 00:37:46.080 line:100%
Hey!

00:37:47.960 --> 00:37:49.240 line:100%
How come it's you?

00:37:49.320 --> 00:37:51.040 line:100%
You scared me to death.

00:37:56.520 --> 00:37:58.880 line:100%
This kid plays games all day.

00:37:58.960 --> 00:38:00.360 line:100%
He's ruined.

00:38:03.840 --> 00:38:05.760 line:100%
-Thanks.
-I forbid him to play.

00:38:06.680 --> 00:38:10.840 line:100%
Well, he hid in the corridor
and kept playing.

00:38:11.880 --> 00:38:13.160 line:100%
What are you wearing?

00:38:13.240 --> 00:38:14.160 line:100%
Women's clothes?

00:38:14.240 --> 00:38:15.760 line:100%
You think I'll go easy on you?

00:38:17.720 --> 00:38:20.080 line:100%
Ma'am, calm down.

00:38:20.160 --> 00:38:21.320 line:100%
He's just a kid.

00:38:25.000 --> 00:38:27.480 line:100%
-Unbelievable.
-Ma'am.

00:38:28.280 --> 00:38:29.640 line:100%
These…

00:38:32.400 --> 00:38:34.200 line:100%
Playing games all day long.

00:38:35.320 --> 00:38:37.440 line:100%
It's summer vacation. So I'm playing.

00:38:37.520 --> 00:38:38.760 line:100%
-What's the big deal?
-"What's the big deal"?

00:38:39.840 --> 00:38:43.200 line:100%
Ma'am, I'm here to learn
about the missing person.

00:38:43.280 --> 00:38:46.320 line:100%
They say this floor
was Pattia's staff dorm before.

00:38:46.400 --> 00:38:50.120 line:100%
Pattia was seized before I moved here.

00:38:50.200 --> 00:38:54.040 line:100%
Have you seen anything weird
in the building recently?

00:38:55.360 --> 00:38:57.880 line:100%
The two next door moved out last month.

00:38:57.960 --> 00:38:59.280 line:100%
Business was bad.

00:39:00.040 --> 00:39:02.920 line:100%
The one across, 1703, is a residence.

00:39:03.000 --> 00:39:05.680 line:100%
We only hear men and women
crying and shouting

00:39:05.760 --> 00:39:07.320 line:100%
in the middle of the night.

00:39:07.920 --> 00:39:09.120 line:100%
It's so…

00:39:10.840 --> 00:39:11.920 line:100%
You know?

00:39:13.280 --> 00:39:15.680 line:100%
So, 1703 is not a store?

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:18.400 line:100%
Officer Ran. I forgot.

00:39:18.480 --> 00:39:21.200 line:100%
Room 1703 is the biggest.

00:39:21.280 --> 00:39:22.600 line:100%
Mr. Song keeps it for himself.

00:39:24.520 --> 00:39:29.080 line:100%
They say Mr. Song
keeps his mistress in 1703.

00:39:29.160 --> 00:39:30.120 line:100%
Shush!

00:39:33.040 --> 00:39:35.720 line:100%
Ma'am, have you seen him

00:39:36.760 --> 00:39:37.960 line:100%
bringing anyone?

00:39:39.000 --> 00:39:42.600 line:100%
But often, some flashy-dressed women

00:39:42.680 --> 00:39:44.480 line:100%
come to get clothes altered.

00:39:45.200 --> 00:39:46.640 line:100%
Guess what.

00:39:46.720 --> 00:39:50.080 line:100%
The thing is, it's never
the same person twice.

00:39:53.320 --> 00:39:55.880 line:100%
Ma'am, have you seen this woman?

00:39:57.200 --> 00:39:58.400 line:100%
How can I remember?

00:39:58.480 --> 00:40:00.720 line:100%
I do my best to avoid them. What bad luck.

00:40:02.760 --> 00:40:06.360 line:100%
Don't you want to ask about 1703?

00:40:06.440 --> 00:40:07.480 line:100%
Mr. Song is home.

00:40:09.000 --> 00:40:10.480 line:100%
Song Qingsong is home?

00:40:10.560 --> 00:40:11.840 line:100%
Yeah.

00:40:12.360 --> 00:40:15.640 line:100%
That door squeaks whenever it opens.

00:40:15.720 --> 00:40:17.880 line:100%
I would know if he comes out.

00:40:45.240 --> 00:40:47.360 line:100%
What is this?

00:40:51.360 --> 00:40:52.280 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:40:53.320 --> 00:40:56.000 line:100%
Are you home? I'm the property manager.

00:40:59.560 --> 00:41:00.840 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:41:02.360 --> 00:41:03.360 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:41:09.120 --> 00:41:09.960 line:100%
Hello.

00:41:10.040 --> 00:41:11.680 line:100%
Police, Nanshan Branch.

00:41:11.760 --> 00:41:13.360 line:100%
I have some questions.

00:41:13.440 --> 00:41:15.360 line:100%
I know you're home. Please open the door.

00:41:19.720 --> 00:41:20.760 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:41:25.160 --> 00:41:26.320 line:100%
Are you Song Qingsong?

00:41:27.000 --> 00:41:30.160 line:100%
No. I'm Mr. Song's secretary.

00:41:30.240 --> 00:41:31.520 line:100%
I came to get some papers.

00:41:31.600 --> 00:41:33.040 line:100%
What can I do for you?

00:41:35.920 --> 00:41:38.320 line:100%
-Let me take a look.
-I'm afraid I can't.

00:41:39.760 --> 00:41:41.360 line:100%
This is not my place.

00:41:41.440 --> 00:41:43.320 line:100%
I don't have a say here.

00:41:44.320 --> 00:41:45.640 line:100%
When is he coming back?

00:41:45.720 --> 00:41:48.760 line:100%
Well… I'm not sure.

00:41:48.840 --> 00:41:52.160 line:100%
He usually gets drunk at night
and sleeps here.

00:41:56.920 --> 00:41:59.400 line:100%
Officer, he's in a hurry for these files.

00:41:59.480 --> 00:42:01.680 line:100%
If you've got nothing else,
please head back.

00:42:04.040 --> 00:42:05.640 line:100%
It's too hot. Can I have some water?

00:42:05.720 --> 00:42:06.600 line:100%
The water is out.

00:42:07.520 --> 00:42:10.360 line:100%
-Coke is fine, too.
-Coke is for me.

00:42:19.920 --> 00:42:20.920 line:100%
Shit!

00:42:21.000 --> 00:42:22.560 line:100%
This guy is a burglar.

00:42:22.640 --> 00:42:24.720 line:100%
Ouch. Ma Qiang. Push.

00:42:24.800 --> 00:42:26.760 line:100%
This guy is a burglar.

00:42:27.920 --> 00:42:29.360 line:100%
-Lock the door.
-Okay.

00:42:37.760 --> 00:42:38.760 line:100%
Go.

00:42:38.840 --> 00:42:41.760 line:100%
Dad. What's the next move
of the horse stance side strike?

00:42:41.840 --> 00:42:43.880 line:100%
Kick. Throat lock.

00:42:46.680 --> 00:42:48.240 line:100%
Teach me again.

00:42:49.080 --> 00:42:52.480 line:100%
You're biting off more than you can chew.

00:42:55.680 --> 00:42:57.320 line:100%
GOLDEN ROCK AUDIO SHOP OPENING

00:42:57.400 --> 00:42:59.560 line:100%
The rock singers all look weird.

00:43:00.160 --> 00:43:01.920 line:100%
Rocking and rolling.
How can they look good?

00:43:03.000 --> 00:43:05.160 line:100%
What a heavy bag for a third grader.

00:43:06.000 --> 00:43:09.760 line:100%
The teachers and parents
are oppressing children.

00:43:09.840 --> 00:43:11.880 line:100%
Dad. Are we going to Grandma's?

00:43:11.960 --> 00:43:13.280 line:100%
Do you like Grandma's place, kiddo?

00:43:13.360 --> 00:43:14.400 line:100%
Yeah, of course.

00:43:14.480 --> 00:43:16.280 line:100%
She has Hua and Huang.

00:43:16.360 --> 00:43:18.560 line:100%
We can catch mice in the yard.

00:43:19.080 --> 00:43:20.080 line:100%
Then let's go to Grandma's.

00:43:21.880 --> 00:43:23.720 line:100%
-Dad, you're the best.
-Get in.

00:43:28.920 --> 00:43:31.720 line:100%
<i>Got a lead. Return to the unit. Ran.</i>

00:43:37.880 --> 00:43:41.360 line:100%
Xiaohe. We won't go to Grandma's yet.

00:43:41.960 --> 00:43:44.200 line:100%
Dad. You're going back on your word again.

00:43:45.400 --> 00:43:48.440 line:100%
Want to see where Dad works?

00:43:48.520 --> 00:43:49.760 line:100%
The police station?

00:43:49.840 --> 00:43:52.040 line:100%
Are there a lot of bad people
locked up there?

00:43:52.120 --> 00:43:53.040 line:100%
Are you afraid?

00:43:53.120 --> 00:43:55.840 line:100%
Not at all. My dad catches bad guys.

00:43:56.640 --> 00:43:57.520 line:100%
Alright, sit tight.

00:44:07.280 --> 00:44:09.480 line:100%
Slow down. What's the rush?

00:44:10.040 --> 00:44:11.440 line:100%
Officer Zhang. Officer Li.

00:44:11.520 --> 00:44:12.440 line:100%
You clown.

00:44:12.520 --> 00:44:14.080 line:100%
You're kind of a regular here.

00:44:14.160 --> 00:44:15.160 line:100%
Can't bear to leave, huh?

00:44:16.120 --> 00:44:18.520 line:100%
-Thanks. You helped us a lot.
-No problem.

00:44:22.080 --> 00:44:24.760 line:100%
I'd like to borrow the loot.

00:44:25.680 --> 00:44:26.560 line:100%
Huh?

00:44:30.360 --> 00:44:32.800 line:100%
Dad. What did he do?

00:44:34.040 --> 00:44:36.200 line:100%
Officer He. Long time no see.

00:44:36.280 --> 00:44:37.800 line:100%
Keep your mouth shut.

00:44:37.880 --> 00:44:39.240 line:100%
Just saying hi.

00:44:39.320 --> 00:44:40.600 line:100%
He's a pickpocket.

00:44:40.680 --> 00:44:42.160 line:100%
I've caught him before.

00:44:42.840 --> 00:44:44.360 line:100%
Does he really pick pockets?

00:44:46.240 --> 00:44:48.600 line:100%
Xiaohe. Say hi to Uncle Ran.

00:44:48.680 --> 00:44:49.640 line:100%
Hello, Xiaohe.

00:44:51.520 --> 00:44:54.880 line:100%
You're Uncle Ran, the graduate from PPSUC?

00:44:55.920 --> 00:44:57.440 line:100%
You're pretty well-informed.

00:44:57.520 --> 00:45:01.360 line:100%
My mom told my dad to learn from you.

00:45:01.440 --> 00:45:03.040 line:100%
Don't talk nonsense.

00:45:03.120 --> 00:45:04.480 line:100%
How am I talking nonsense?

00:45:04.560 --> 00:45:07.280 line:100%
My mom also said
that you should butter up Uncle Ran

00:45:07.360 --> 00:45:09.360 line:100%
so he can promote you
once he becomes an official.

00:45:09.440 --> 00:45:11.120 line:100%
Finished your summer break homework?

00:45:14.600 --> 00:45:17.160 line:100%
Xiaohe. Uncle Ran and I
have things to talk about.

00:45:17.240 --> 00:45:18.600 line:100%
Go to the office. Finish your homework.

00:45:18.680 --> 00:45:20.840 line:100%
No. I’m going to play
basketball in the yard.

00:45:20.920 --> 00:45:22.080 line:100%
Hey you!

00:45:22.160 --> 00:45:25.120 line:100%
Uncle Ran. Come play when you're done.

00:45:25.200 --> 00:45:26.320 line:100%
What a kid…

00:45:29.040 --> 00:45:30.760 line:100%
Right, He. Song Qingsong…

00:45:30.840 --> 00:45:33.040 line:100%
I've figured out what to do about him.

00:45:33.120 --> 00:45:34.560 line:100%
Let's wait for him outside
the cement factory.

00:45:34.640 --> 00:45:35.920 line:100%
-Once he comes out…
-No.

00:45:36.000 --> 00:45:37.720 line:100%
He will be here soon.

00:45:38.880 --> 00:45:39.800 line:100%
Huh?